{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.tenka.first",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "试镜室里很安静",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.tenka.first",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.tenka.first",
    "idolId": "tenka",
    "startNodeId": "1",
    "nodes": {
      "1": {
        "id": "1",
        "speakerId": "tenka",
        "text": "……",
        "nextNodeId": "2"
      },
      "2": {
        "id": "2",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "大崎甜花小姐，是吧。今天请多指教。",
        "nextNodeId": "3"
      },
      "3": {
        "id": "3",
        "speakerId": "tenka",
        "text": "呜哇！……是、是……请多指教……",
        "nextNodeId": "4"
      },
      "4": {
        "id": "4",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "呃……抱歉，吓到你了吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "5"
      },
      "5": {
        "id": "5",
        "speakerId": "tenka",
        "text": "不、不是的……那个……",
        "nextNodeId": "6"
      },
      "6": {
        "id": "6",
        "speakerId": "tenka",
        "text": "甜花……不太跟别人说话……所以，只是稍微，吓了一跳……而已……",
        "nextNodeId": "7"
      },
      "7": {
        "id": "7",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "这样啊。不过是试镜，不用太紧张，开心地聊就好。",
        "nextNodeId": "8"
      },
      "8": {
        "id": "8",
        "speakerId": "tenka",
        "text": "开心地聊……诶、呃……甜花会努力……",
        "nextNodeId": "9"
      },
      "9": {
        "id": "9",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "那，大崎小姐为什么会想当偶像呢？",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "tenka",
        "text": "那个……甜花对偶像……其实不太懂……",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "tenka",
        "text": "是因为なーちゃん说，一起当偶像吧……才来的……",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "なーちゃん？",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "tenka",
        "text": "啊，呃……なーちゃん是……甜花的妹妹……甘奈，所以……甜花叫她なーちゃん……",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（妹妹……资料上写着有双胞胎妹妹，就是那个孩子啊。）",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "这样啊。妹妹一句话就让你想当偶像，你很喜欢她呢。",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "tenka",
        "text": "是……なーちゃん一直很温柔、很有精神……甜花，最喜欢她……",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "是个好孩子呢。",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "tenka",
        "text": "嘿嘿……甜花也想过，自己能当偶像吗……",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "tenka",
        "text": "可是なーちゃん那样说了……所以，为了なーちゃん，甜花想努力试试……",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "原来如此……",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（说到妹妹时的笑容……看到这个笑容，连我都要开心起来了。）",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（把周围的魅力引出来，也许能成为很厉害的偶像！）",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "好，你合格了！",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "tenka",
        "text": "诶……真的……？甜花……当偶像……？",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯，我就是你的制作人。请多指教，甜花。",
        "nextNodeId": "26"
      },
      "26": {
        "id": "26",
        "speakerId": "tenka",
        "text": "是、是……",
        "nextNodeId": "27"
      },
      "27": {
        "id": "27",
        "speakerId": "tenka",
        "text": "甜花……会努力肥！",
        "nextNodeId": "28"
      },
      "28": {
        "id": "28",
        "speakerId": "tenka",
        "text": "啊，会努力的……！"
      }
    }
  },
